# 仓库统一使用 LF：索引和检出内容都保持 LF，Windows 上也不例外。
# 这里显式覆盖 core.autocrlf，避免不同机器检出出不同的换行。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换，避免图片、图标、音频和打包产物被改写。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.svg text
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.wav binary
*.flac binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.aar binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary

# Windows 批处理需要 CRLF，否则部分命令解释器会读错行。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
